Article 2 (Preparation for establishment of EPIS)
(1) The Minister of Food, Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries shall establish an Establishment Committee for Korea Agency of Education, Promotion and Information Service in Food Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries (hereinafter referred to as "the Establishment Committee") by entrusting seven committee members within 30 days after the promulgation of this Act to manage affairs related to establishment of EPIS.
